---
interface Props { data?: any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---

<div class="pregnancy-weight">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <a class="crumb" href="/salud">Salud</a>
        <span class="eyebrow">Aumento de peso en el embarazo</span>
        <h1>¿Cuánto peso es esperable subir en cada semana?</h1>
        <p>Ingresá tu peso de antes, tu altura, la semana y tu peso actual. Vas a ver tu aumento, el rango orientativo para este momento y el rango total recomendado.</p>
        <ul class="trust">
          <li>Rangos IOM 2009</li>
          <li>Embarazo de un solo bebé</li>
          <li>No guardamos tus datos</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <form class="calculator" novalidate>
        <header>
          <span>Paso 1 de 1</span>
          <h2>Completá tus datos</h2>
          <p>Usá el peso que tenías justo antes del embarazo.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="fields">
          <label><span>Peso antes del embarazo</span><div><input id="pre" type="number" min="30" max="200" step="0.1" value="62" inputmode="decimal" required><b>kg</b></div></label>
          <label><span>Altura</span><div><input id="height" type="number" min="130" max="210" step="1" value="165" inputmode="numeric" required><b>cm</b></div></label>
          <label><span>Semana de embarazo</span><div><input id="week" type="number" min="1" max="42" step="1" value="24" inputmode="numeric" required><b>sem.</b></div></label>
          <label><span>Peso actual</span><div><input id="now" type="number" min="30" max="220" step="0.1" value="69" inputmode="decimal" required><b>kg</b></div></label>
        </div>
        <p class="error" id="error" role="alert"></p>
        <button type="button" id="calculate">Ver mi rango orientativo</button>
        <p class="privacy">El cálculo se hace en tu navegador. Ningún dato se envía ni se guarda.</p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="result-section" aria-live="polite">
    <div class="wrap">
      <header class="result-heading">
        <span id="status-kicker">Tu resultado</span>
        <h2 id="status-title">Tu aumento está dentro del rango orientativo</h2>
        <p id="status-copy">Esta referencia se basa en tu IMC previo y en la semana de embarazo.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="result-grid">
        <article class="summary-card">
          <div class="main-number"><span>Subiste hasta ahora</span><strong id="gain">7 kg</strong></div>
          <div class="range-card"><span>Rango orientativo en la semana <b id="week-label">24</b></span><strong id="week-range">3,1 a 7,2 kg</strong></div>
          <dl>
            <div><dt>IMC antes del embarazo</dt><dd id="bmi">22,8 · rango normal</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Rango para todo el embarazo</dt><dd id="total-range">11,5 a 16 kg</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Peso orientativo hoy</dt><dd id="weight-range">65,1 a 69,2 kg</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </article>

        <article class="chart-card">
          <div class="chart-head"><div><span>Tu progreso</span><h3>Aumento acumulado por semana</h3></div><div class="legend"><i></i>Rango orientativo <b></b>Tu medición</div></div>
          <svg id="chart" viewBox="0 0 720 360" role="img" aria-label="Curva de aumento de peso durante el embarazo" aria-describedby="chart-desc"></svg>
          <span class="sr-only" id="chart-desc">La zona verde representa el rango orientativo y el punto indica tu aumento actual.</span>
          <p>La curva sirve para mirar una tendencia, no para aprobar o desaprobar una medición aislada.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <aside class="medical-note">
        <strong>Importante</strong>
        <p>Es una orientación poblacional, no un diagnóstico. Un cambio brusco de peso, hinchazón repentina, vómitos persistentes, hipertensión, diabetes, embarazo múltiple u otra condición requieren una evaluación personalizada por el equipo obstétrico.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  {data && <section class="content wrap">
    <article>
      <span class="eyebrow">Cómo leer el resultado</span>
      <h2>No existe un único aumento correcto para todas</h2>
      <p>El rango depende del índice de masa corporal previo al embarazo. Durante el primer trimestre suele haber poco aumento; desde el segundo, la referencia pasa a ser una curva semanal. Lo importante es la evolución completa junto con el crecimiento fetal y los controles clínicos.</p>
      <div class="ranges">
        <div><b>IMC menor a 18,5</b><strong>12,5–18 kg</strong><span>Bajo peso previo</span></div>
        <div><b>IMC 18,5–24,9</b><strong>11,5–16 kg</strong><span>Rango normal previo</span></div>
        <div><b>IMC 25–29,9</b><strong>7–11,5 kg</strong><span>Sobrepeso previo</span></div>
        <div><b>IMC 30 o más</b><strong>5–9 kg</strong><span>Obesidad previa</span></div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <div class="support-grid">
      <div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq?.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div>
      <aside><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources?.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{s.name}<small>{s.publisher}</small></a>)}</aside>
    </div>
  </section>}
</div>

<script is:inline>
(()=>{const root=document.querySelector('.pregnancy-weight'),q=s=>root.querySelector(s),fmt=n=>new Intl.NumberFormat('es-AR',{maximumFractionDigits:1}).format(n),values=()=>({pre:Number(q('#pre').value),height:Number(q('#height').value),week:Number(q('#week').value),now:Number(q('#now').value)});
const profile=bmi=>bmi<18.5?{label:'bajo peso',min:12.5,max:18}:bmi<25?{label:'rango normal',min:11.5,max:16}:bmi<30?{label:'sobrepeso',min:7,max:11.5}:{label:'obesidad',min:5,max:9};
const atWeek=(p,w)=>{if(w<=13){const f=w/13;return{min:.5*f,max:2*f}}const f=Math.min(1,(w-13)/27);return{min:.5+f*(p.min-.5),max:2+f*(p.max-2)}};
const draw=(p,w,gain)=>{const svg=q('#chart'),W=720,H=380,L=62,R=20,T=42,B=48,maxY=Math.max(20,Math.ceil((Math.max(p.max,gain)+2)/5)*5),minY=Math.min(0,Math.floor(Math.min(0,gain-1)/5)*5),x=s=>L+((s-1)/41)*(W-L-R),y=k=>T+((maxY-k)/(maxY-minY))*(H-T-B),low=[],high=[];for(let s=1;s<=42;s++){const r=atWeek(p,s);low.push([x(s),y(r.min)]);high.push([x(s),y(r.max)])}const path=pts=>pts.map((v,i)=>(i?'L':'M')+v[0].toFixed(1)+' '+v[1].toFixed(1)).join(' '),area=path(high)+' '+path([...low].reverse()).replace(/^M/,'L')+' Z';let grid='';for(let k=minY;k<=maxY;k+=5)grid+=`<line class="grid" x1="${L}" y1="${y(k)}" x2="${W-R}" y2="${y(k)}"/><text class="axis-label" x="${L-12}" y="${y(k)+4}" text-anchor="end">${k} kg</text>`;for(const s of [1,13,20,28,36,42])grid+=`<line class="week-tick" x1="${x(s)}" y1="${H-B}" x2="${x(s)}" y2="${H-B+5}"/><text class="axis-label" x="${x(s)}" y="${H-25}" text-anchor="middle">${s}</text>`;const trimesters=`<rect class="trimester t1" x="${x(1)}" y="${T}" width="${x(13)-x(1)}" height="${H-T-B}"/><rect class="trimester t2" x="${x(13)}" y="${T}" width="${x(28)-x(13)}" height="${H-T-B}"/><rect class="trimester t3" x="${x(28)}" y="${T}" width="${x(42)-x(28)}" height="${H-T-B}"/><text class="trimester-label" x="${(x(1)+x(13))/2}" y="${T-14}" text-anchor="middle">1.er trimestre</text><text class="trimester-label" x="${(x(13)+x(28))/2}" y="${T-14}" text-anchor="middle">2.º trimestre</text><text class="trimester-label" x="${(x(28)+x(42))/2}" y="${T-14}" text-anchor="middle">3.er trimestre</text>`;const px=x(w),py=y(gain),bubbleW=126,bubbleH=48,bx=w>33?px-bubbleW-13:px+13,by=Math.max(T+8,Math.min(H-B-bubbleH-8,py-bubbleH/2));svg.setAttribute('viewBox',`0 0 ${W} ${H}`);svg.innerHTML=`<defs><linearGradient id="preg-range" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#b9e1d1" stop-opacity=".9"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#e9f6f0" stop-opacity=".72"/></linearGradient><filter id="preg-shadow" x="-30%" y="-30%" width="160%" height="160%"><feDropShadow dx="0" dy="4" stdDeviation="5" flood-color="#7c3145" flood-opacity=".2"/></filter></defs><rect class="plot-bg" x="${L}" y="${T}" width="${W-L-R}" height="${H-T-B}" rx="12"/>${trimesters}${grid}<path class="band" d="${area}"/><path class="range-edge" d="${path(high)}"/><path class="range-edge" d="${path(low)}"/><line class="current-guide" x1="${px}" y1="${T}" x2="${px}" y2="${H-B}"/><circle class="point-halo" cx="${px}" cy="${py}" r="14"/><circle class="point" cx="${px}" cy="${py}" r="8"/><g class="bubble" filter="url(#preg-shadow)"><rect x="${bx}" y="${by}" width="${bubbleW}" height="${bubbleH}" rx="10"/><text class="bubble-text" x="${bx+12}" y="${by+20}">${fmt(gain)} kg</text><text class="bubble-sub" x="${bx+12}" y="${by+36}">Semana ${w}</text></g><text class="x-title" x="${(L+W-R)/2}" y="${H-2}" text-anchor="middle">Semana de embarazo</text>`;q('#chart-desc').textContent=`Rango orientativo entre ${fmt(atWeek(p,w).min)} y ${fmt(atWeek(p,w).max)} kilos en la semana ${w}. Tu medición indica ${fmt(gain)} kilos de aumento.`};
const render=()=>{const{pre,height,week,now}=values(),error=q('#error');error.textContent='';if(!pre||pre<30||pre>200)return error.textContent='Revisá el peso anterior: debe estar entre 30 y 200 kg.';if(!height||height<130||height>210)return error.textContent='Revisá la altura: debe estar entre 130 y 210 cm.';if(!week||week<1||week>42)return error.textContent='La semana debe estar entre 1 y 42.';if(!now||now<30||now>220)return error.textContent='Revisá el peso actual: debe estar entre 30 y 220 kg.';const bmi=pre/((height/100)**2),p=profile(bmi),r=atWeek(p,week),gain=now-pre,inside=gain>=r.min&&gain<=r.max,below=gain<r.min,status=inside?'dentro':below?'por debajo':'por encima';q('#status-kicker').textContent=`Semana ${week} · referencia orientativa`;q('#status-title').textContent=inside?'Tu aumento está dentro del rango orientativo':`Tu aumento aparece ${status} del rango orientativo`;q('#status-copy').textContent=inside?'La tendencia coincide con la referencia poblacional para tus datos. Igual, el control obstétrico es el que confirma que la evolución sea adecuada.':'Una medición aislada no define un problema ni indica que tengas que cambiar la alimentación. Comentá la tendencia en tu próximo control.';q('.result-heading').dataset.status=status;q('#gain').textContent=`${fmt(gain)} kg`;q('#week-label').textContent=week;q('#week-range').textContent=`${fmt(r.min)} a ${fmt(r.max)} kg`;q('#bmi').textContent=`${fmt(bmi)} · ${p.label}`;q('#total-range').textContent=`${fmt(p.min)} a ${fmt(p.max)} kg`;q('#weight-range').textContent=`${fmt(pre+r.min)} a ${fmt(pre+r.max)} kg`;draw(p,week,gain)};
root.querySelectorAll('input').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('input',render));q('#calculate').addEventListener('click',()=>{render();if(!q('#error').textContent)q('.result-section').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'})});render()})();
</script>

<style>
.pregnancy-weight{--ink:#172834;--muted:#657780;--green:#177a63;--green-soft:#eaf6f1;--rose:#c85f78;--paper:#f5f8f6;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}.pregnancy-weight *{box-sizing:border-box}.wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}.hero{padding:54px 0 66px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0f8f4 0%,#fff8f5 100%)}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 470px;gap:72px;align-items:center}.crumb{display:inline-block;color:var(--green);font-size:13px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:38px}.eyebrow{display:block;color:var(--green);font-size:12px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(42px,5.2vw,66px);line-height:1.01;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:14px 0 20px;max-width:680px}.hero-copy>p{max-width:650px;color:var(--muted);font-size:18px;line-height:1.65}.trust{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;padding:0;margin:28px 0 0;list-style:none}.trust li{padding:8px 11px;border:1px solid #d5e5de;background:#ffffffa8;border-radius:9px;font-size:11px;font-weight:750}.trust li:before{content:'✓';color:var(--green);margin-right:6px}.calculator{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce8e3;border-radius:24px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 26px 70px #274d3e16}.calculator header>span{color:var(--green);font-size:10px;font-weight:850;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em}.calculator h2{font-size:27px;margin:5px 0}.calculator header p{margin:0 0 20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.fields label>span{display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 6px}.fields label>div{display:flex;align-items:center;border:1px solid #d9e3df;border-radius:11px;padding:0 11px;background:#fbfcfb}.fields input{width:100%;border:0;background:transparent;padding:13px 0;font:800 16px Inter;color:var(--ink);outline:0}.fields label>div:focus-within{border-color:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #daf0e8}.fields b{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.calculator button{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:15px;margin-top:8px;background:var(--green);color:#fff;font-weight:850;cursor:pointer}.calculator button:focus-visible,.content a:focus-visible,.crumb:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #f1adba;outline-offset:3px}.privacy{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;margin:10px 0 0}.error{min-height:20px;margin:8px 0 0;color:#a42643;font-size:11px;font-weight:750}.result-section{padding:70px 0;background:var(--paper);scroll-margin-top:20px}.result-heading{text-align:center;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 30px}.result-heading>span{color:var(--green);font-weight:850;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em}.result-heading h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,45px);letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0}.result-heading p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.result-heading[data-status="por encima"]>span,.result-heading[data-status="por debajo"]>span{color:#a14b60}.result-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:380px 1fr;gap:20px}.summary-card,.chart-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce6e1;border-radius:22px;padding:25px}.main-number span,.range-card span{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;font-weight:750}.main-number strong{display:block;font-size:52px;letter-spacing:-.06em;color:var(--green);margin-top:2px}.range-card{padding:16px;background:var(--green-soft);border-radius:13px;margin:16px 0}.range-card strong{display:block;font-size:23px;margin-top:4px}.summary-card dl{margin:0}.summary-card dl div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e7ece9}.summary-card dl div:last-child{border:0}.summary-card dt{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}.summary-card dd{margin:0;text-align:right;font-size:12px;font-weight:850}.chart-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start}.chart-head span{font-size:10px;color:var(--green);font-weight:850;text-transform:uppercase}.chart-head h3{font-size:22px;margin:3px 0}.legend{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap}.legend i{width:18px;height:9px;background:#d8eee5}.legend b{width:18px;height:3px;background:var(--rose);margin-left:8px}.chart-card svg{width:100%;height:auto;margin-top:10px;overflow:visible}.chart-card>p{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.chart-card :global(.grid){stroke:#e5ebe8;stroke-width:1}.chart-card :global(.band){fill:#d8eee5}.chart-card :global(.progress){stroke:var(--rose);stroke-width:4}.chart-card :global(.point){fill:var(--rose);stroke:#fff;stroke-width:4}.chart-card :global(.axis-label),.chart-card :global(.x-title){font:10px Inter;fill:#72817b}.chart-card :global(.point-label){font:700 11px Inter;fill:#9e4058}.medical-note{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:20px;padding:18px 22px;border:1px solid #e7c9d0;background:#fff8fa;border-radius:15px}.medical-note strong{color:#9e4058}.medical-note p{margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#5f7078}.content{padding:76px 0}.content>article{text-align:center}.content>article>h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,44px);letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0}.content>article>p{max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}.ranges{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin:28px 0 76px;text-align:left}.ranges div{border:1px solid #dfe7e3;border-radius:15px;padding:17px}.ranges b,.ranges span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}.ranges strong{display:block;font-size:21px;margin:7px 0}.support-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:44px}.support-grid h2{font-size:24px}.support-grid details{border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6e3;padding:15px 0}.support-grid summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:780;font-size:13px}.support-grid details p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted)}.support-grid aside a{display:block;padding:13px;border:1px solid #dfe7e3;border-radius:11px;margin:8px 0;color:var(--green);text-decoration:none;font-size:11px;font-weight:750}.support-grid aside small{display:block;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}
.chart-card :global(.plot-bg){fill:#fbfdfc;stroke:#e4ebe7}.chart-card :global(.trimester){pointer-events:none}.chart-card :global(.trimester.t1){fill:#f9f3f5}.chart-card :global(.trimester.t2){fill:#f4faf7}.chart-card :global(.trimester.t3){fill:#eef7f3}.chart-card :global(.trimester-label){font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;fill:#718078;letter-spacing:.03em}.chart-card :global(.week-tick){stroke:#aab8b1}.chart-card :global(.band){fill:url(#preg-range)}.chart-card :global(.range-edge){fill:none;stroke:#6cae93;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-dasharray:4 4}.chart-card :global(.current-guide){stroke:#c85f78;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-dasharray:5 5}.chart-card :global(.point-halo){fill:#f8dce3;opacity:.9}.chart-card :global(.point){fill:#c85f78;stroke:#fff;stroke-width:3}.chart-card :global(.bubble rect){fill:#fff}.chart-card :global(.bubble-text){font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;fill:#85364b}.chart-card :global(.bubble-sub){font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;fill:#72817b}.chart-card :global(.x-title){font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;fill:#72817b}.chart-card :global(.grid){stroke:#dfe8e3;stroke-width:1}.chart-card :global(.axis-label){font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:10px;fill:#72817b}
.pregnancy-weight .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}
@media(max-width:900px){.hero-grid,.result-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero-grid{gap:36px}.calculator{max-width:620px}.ranges{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media(max-width:600px){.wrap{width:min(100% - 28px,1160px)}.hero{padding:28px 0 46px}.crumb{margin-bottom:25px}.hero h1{font-size:40px}.hero-copy>p{font-size:15px}.calculator{padding:20px 16px}.fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}.result-section{padding:50px 0}.result-heading{text-align:left}.summary-card,.chart-card{padding:18px}.main-number strong{font-size:45px}.chart-head{display:block}.legend{margin-top:8px}.medical-note{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:4px}.ranges,.support-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.ranges{margin-bottom:55px}.content{padding:55px 0}}
</style>
